      "unlockDate" : 759970800,
      "steps" : "Instructions:\n1. Marinate the chicken: Mix olive oil, spices, and lemon juice in a bowl. Coat the chicken and let it marinate for at least 30 minutes (overnight is best).\n2. Cook: Heat a pan or grill over medium-high heat. Cook chicken for 5-7 minutes per side until golden and fully cooked.\n3. Slice: Let the chicken rest for a few minutes, then slice thinly.\n4. Assemble: Fill pita with sliced chicken, garlic sauce, and veggies.\n5. Enjoy!\n\nEnjoy your homemade Chicken Shawarma! 🥙🔥",
